*chmod* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''chmod(path, mode)''

Changes the permissions of the file or directory at path.

*Parameters:*
- ''path'': String path to the file or directory
- ''mode'': File permissions as a 3 or 4 digit number (e.g. 755, 4755)

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if mode is invalid octal
